WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
This is where every collections story starts: arrears growing,
the dashboard shows it, and time runs short.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
First, measure the problem properly: an aging report,
DSO and effectiveness, computed from the portfolio.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The turnaround starts here: upload your portfolio and Kobra
scores it instantly, with each payment probability and its reasons.

4
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:36.000
ProbPago ranks the portfolio by what can actually be recovered:
strategy, the right discount and a script for every debtor.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The agenda builds the day on its own:
who to contact, when, and over which channel.

6
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Then the AI agent executes: it calls the case's number with a natural
voice, negotiates over WhatsApp and generates the charge with its QR.

7
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Debtors can also pay on their own:
they open the portal from a QR code or a link, and pay.

8
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:13.000
The conversational board answers in your own words:
every number comes from your data, not from a guess.

9
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:21.000
A question about the product? The assistant answers right there,
with the documentation built in.

10
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:29.000
The human team is measured here:
recovery by agent, by month and by channel.

11
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:37.000
And quality reviews every interaction:
calling hours, caps and the do-not-contact list, always.

12
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Data engineering included: connect SQL, CSV or Excel;
profiles, joins and features without writing code.

13
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Governance answers which data is personal, who can see it
and how good it is, across the six DAMA dimensions.

14
00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Custom KPIs: define your own indicator with a formula
and use it across the board.

15
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:12.000
AutoML trains a model on your own dataset;
the metric comes from a holdout never used to choose anything.

16
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Logistics, sold separately: what to discount,
what to restock and which customer to win back.

17
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:28.000
And Projects: portfolio health
and the backlog ranked by expected value.

18
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:38.000
The result is measured here: more recovery with less effort.
MV Kobra AI, end to end. mvkobranzaia.com
